Read candidate text as a new reader without assuming the editor's intended change succeeded. Reconstruct operative instructions, exceptions, audiences and temporal scope. Contrast each protected claim with its prior meaning. Check that corrected claims are supported by the resolved source hierarchy and that active links do not point readers silently to obsolete guidance. Name only authorized review owners. Leave approvedBytes null here: semantic review does not manufacture the owner's later approval.
